#N canvas 50 50 1100 1000 12;
#X text 10 10 tapmatrix.tap~ <i> <parent \$0> <j> (clone in tapmatrix.out~) -- the cell input i -> output j: delread4~ with a delay ramp \, times a gain ramp, f 72;
#X text 10 53 set <delay-ms> <gain> <ramp-ms>: to the targets \; during a dip only the targets after it. jump <delay> <gain> <xfade>: fade out \, jump \, fade in. keep <xfade>: the same with the current targets. get <delay-array> <gain-array>: write index j. [r <parent>-clear]: gain 0 now., f 72;
