#X obj 10 173 route set jump keep get;
#N canvas 50 50 538 335 apply 0;
#X text 10 10 apply <delay> <gain> <ramp>: ramps there \; a silent cell (target gain 0) jumps in delay. Holds the targets \, sends them out (2 \, 3) on every change. Right inlet: clear (gain 0 now)., f 72;
